#: ../../tools/pdbe_graph_tools.rst:36 e358a1e8fd20487d9caa5777f0d7c46e
msgid ""
"``pdb_id`` (string) (required) PDB identifier (4-character code, case-"
"insensitive). Examples: '4hhb' (hemoglobin with heme), '1cbs' (CRABP2 "
"with retinoic acid), '6lu7' (SARS-CoV-2 Mpro with inhibitor), '3hyd' "
"(kinase with ATP analog)."
msgstr ""

