"Get detailed chemical compound information from the PDBe Graph API by "
"chemical component ID (3-le..."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pdbe_graph_tools.rst 54083eecdc1045c994f074e9c3c70eb5
msgid "PDBe_get_compound_details tool specification"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pdbe_graph_tools.rst:61 cc4afd5c33db4c9c959b8b694f0f3138
msgid "**Name**: ``PDBe_get_compound_details``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pdbe_graph_tools.rst:63 a137e7e6097b4bffad5a7fcae48d2591
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed chemical compound information from the PDBe"
" Graph API by chemical component ID (3-letter code). Returns chemical "
"formula, molecular weight, SMILES, InChI, InChIKey, systematic names, "
"cross-references to DrugBank/PubChem/ClinicalTrials, and stereoisomer "
"information. More comprehensive than compound name search. Example: 'ATP'"
" returns adenosine-5'-triphosphate with formula C10H16N5O13P3, weight "
"507.181, DrugBank DB00171, PubChem 5957."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pdbe_graph_tools.rst:67 3f856f4e19df4054bdc69cde68dd8e86
msgid ""
"``comp_id`` (string) (required) Chemical component identifier (3-letter "
"PDB ligand code, uppercase). Examples: 'ATP' (adenosine triphosphate), "
"'HEM' (protoporphyrin IX containing FE), 'NAD' (nicotinamide-adenine-"
"dinucleotide), 'FAD' (flavin-adenine dinucleotide), 'REA' (retinoic "
"acid)."
msgstr ""

